    if lang in ("Markdown","MDX","Djot","Plain Text"):
        # For Plain Text/Djot, use comment-all (no embedded? Djot/MDX? MDX may have embedded? Our earlier test MDX? Not tested. For safety, treat MDX like Markdown (with fences)? But MDX is Markdown-like with JSX? Unclear. For now, treat MDX like Markdown (with fences) and Djot/Plain Text as plain (no embedded).
